# Requests for the VS Code REST Client extension (installed in the dev container).
# Start the API with `make api`, then click "Send Request" above each request.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8000

### Health
GET {{baseUrl}}/health

### Fire the sample alert (Datadog webhook format)
# @name alert
POST {{baseUrl}}/webhooks/datadog
Content-Type: application/json

< ../samples/alert_5xx.json

### Poll the incident: trace grows while the agent works, report appears when done
GET {{baseUrl}}/incidents/{{alert.response.body.$.incident_id}}

### The report as Markdown
GET {{baseUrl}}/incidents/{{alert.response.body.$.incident_id}}/report.md

### All incidents
GET {{baseUrl}}/incidents

### Recovery notifications are acknowledged and ignored
POST {{baseUrl}}/webhooks/datadog
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": "7381920045",
  "title": "[Recovered] api-gateway 5xx rate is above 5%",
  "alert_transition": "Recovered",
  "tags": "service:api-gateway,env:prod"
}
